{
  "$meta": {
    "name": "AgriLog v2 design tokens",
    "version": "5.0.0",
    "updatedAt": "2026-09-12",
    "sourceNote": "This file is the SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH: mobile/src/theme.ts and web-admin/src/app/tokens.css are generated from it by `node shared/design/build-tokens.js`. Never hard-code colours in components.",
    "designNote": "v5 replaces the liquid-glass look of the v4 mock-up (docs/design-reference/agrixai-farmer-v4.html) with a flat, quiet system in the spirit of Stripe / Vercel / Apple: white or gray-50 grounds, hairline gray borders, one green primary, soft pastel badges, two light shadows, an 8pt spacing grid. No gradients, no neon, no glassmorphism. See docs/adr/0004-he-thiet-ke-phang.md. The green palette is kept from v4 so the brand colour (#2E6F40) is unchanged.",
    "fontNote": "Open Sans is BUNDLED with the app (mobile/src/assets/fonts, web-admin/public/fonts). Never load it from Google Fonts at runtime - the farmer app must work offline."
  },
